      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/retrogamedeals.bsky.social/post/3mz3xjvawym2m",
      "text": "Hi! Sierra adventures and the Gold Box RPGs are a great pile to dig through. A lot of those DOS classics are sold DRM-free on GOG with the old-PC setup already done, so they run on a modern machine without any tinkering.",
